# Environment template — copy to .env and fill in your own keys.
# NEVER commit the real .env file. It is git-ignored.
#
# SECURITY NOTE: API keys for Mapbox and OpenWeather were previously
# committed to this repository's history. Any token that was ever
# committed must be treated as compromised and must be rotated/revoked
# in the provider dashboard, then replaced with a fresh key in .env.
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
VITE_OPENWEATHER_KEY=
